WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:14.375
Roxy had to get to downtown Metro City.

2
00:00:15.496 --> 00:00:17.477
She had to stop that giant pink blob!

3
00:00:21.179 --> 00:00:21.939
be back soon!"

4
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.260
Roxy said to her friends.

5
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.882
"I'm, uh, going to go look for Mara!"

6
00:00:28.683 --> 00:00:29.524
Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:31.436 --> 00:00:32.476
Jack scratched his head.

8
00:00:32.496 --> 00:00:35.777
"I thought Roxy didn't know where Mara is."

9
00:00:37.058 --> 00:00:37.918
Terrell frowned.

10
00:00:37.938 --> 00:00:40.278
"I hope she comes back soon.

11
00:00:41.139 --> 00:00:43.419
We can't play kickball with just two people."

12
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.421
A minute later Roxy zoomed into downtown Metro City.

13
00:00:52.242 --> 00:00:54.402
The blob was pink and really, really big.

14
00:00:55.362 --> 00:00:58.143
Roxy watched it move slowly up the side of a skyscraper.

15
00:00:58.163 --> 00:01:01.769
"That looks like bubble gum," thought Roxy.

16
00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:03.650
She sniffed the air.

17
00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:06.112
"It smells like bubble gum too!"

18
00:01:07.273 --> 00:01:08.153
"Rocket Girl!"

19
00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:08.994
called a voice.

20
00:01:10.034 --> 00:01:11.035
It was Detective Smith.

21
00:01:11.996 --> 00:01:12.856
Roxy flew to him.

22
00:01:12.876 --> 00:01:15.719
"You know, Detective," she said.

23
00:01:15.739 --> 00:01:18.601
"You're supposed to throw your gum in the trash."

24
00:01:18.621 --> 00:01:22.804
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

25
00:01:22.824 --> 00:01:25.105
"That's not my gum."

26
00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:27.867
"So where did that blob come from?"

27
00:01:28.147 --> 00:01:28.808
asked Roxy.

28
00:01:29.696 --> 00:01:31.037
Detective Smith shook his head.

29
00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:32.977
"Nobody knows.

30
00:01:33.898 --> 00:01:36.439
It's been here for an hour, and it keeps growing.

31
00:01:37.399 --> 00:01:40.460
If we don't do something soon, it will cover the entire city!"

32
00:01:42.681 --> 00:01:43.922
A bus came around the corner.

33
00:01:43.942 --> 00:01:48.404
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver.

34
00:01:49.404 --> 00:01:50.565
He slammed on the brakes.

35
00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:53.666
Screech! The bus skidded.

36
00:01:55.747 --> 00:01:56.807
The blob reached out.

37
00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.421
Shlurp! Pink slime oozed all over the bus.

38
00:02:02.241 --> 00:02:03.761
The blob pulled the bus closer.

39
00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:06.062
Everyone inside began to scream.

40
00:02:06.082 --> 00:02:08.463
"Rocket Girl, save us!"

41
00:02:08.483 --> 00:02:10.923
"Help! Help!"

42
00:02:10.943 --> 00:02:13.324
"This is terrible!"

43
00:02:13.664 --> 00:02:14.284
cried a man.

44
00:02:14.304 --> 00:02:16.705
"I'm going to be late for work!"

45
00:02:18.205 --> 00:02:20.426
Roxy shot toward the bus and grabbed its bumper.

46
00:02:22.826 --> 00:02:24.247
She pulled as hard as she could.

47
00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:28.108
"Grr!" Roxy grunted.

48
00:02:29.456 --> 00:02:31.898
Shloop! The bus came free of the blob.

49
00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:35.801
"Thank you, Rocket Girl," said the driver.

50
00:02:36.922 --> 00:02:37.863
The blob groaned.

51
00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:41.466
Grarg! "What's it doing?"

52
00:02:41.846 --> 00:02:42.647
Roxy wondered.

53
00:02:43.588 --> 00:02:46.610
Grarg! The blob was growing some more.

54
00:02:48.112 --> 00:02:50.474
It soon filled the street and attached to another building.

55
00:02:50.494 --> 00:02:52.996
"Uh-oh," said Roxy.

56
00:02:53.016 --> 00:02:55.238
"The blob is getting bigger!"

57
00:02:56.359 --> 00:02:57.620
Roxy turned to the bus driver.

58
00:02:58.548 --> 00:02:59.689
"Drive away from here!

59
00:03:00.029 --> 00:03:05.673
Now!" The bus sped away as the blob moved to a third building.

60
00:03:06.714 --> 00:03:09.316
Suddenly Roxy heard a muffled sound.

61
00:03:09.536 --> 00:03:10.677
"What's that sound?"

62
00:03:10.997 --> 00:03:11.738
Roxy wondered.

63
00:03:13.179 --> 00:03:14.660
She listened with her super hearing.

64
00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:18.763
"Help! Help!"

65
00:03:21.165 --> 00:03:23.286
Roxy shot around to the other side of the blob.

66
00:03:24.307 --> 00:03:25.348
Someone was stuck in it.

67
00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.323
Roxy used her super strength to pull the person out.

68
00:03:31.345 --> 00:03:32.125
It was Mara!

69
00:03:34.228 --> 00:03:34.928
"Rocket Girl!"

70
00:03:35.129 --> 00:03:35.729
cried Mara.

71
00:03:35.749 --> 00:03:37.912
"I'm glad to see you!

72
00:03:38.953 --> 00:03:41.736
My bubble gum It tried to eat me!"
